#. :src: bpy.types.FileSelectParams.filter_glob
msgid ""
"UNIX shell-like filename patterns matching, supports wildcards ('*') and "
"list of patterns separated by ';'"
msgstr ""
"Matchning av Unix-skalliknande filnamnsmönster med stöd för jokertecknet "
"('*') och en lista med mönster åtskilda av ';'"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileSelectParams.filter_id
msgid "Filter ID Types"
msgstr "Filtrera ID-typer"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileSelectParams.filter_search
msgid "Name or Tag Filter"
msgstr "Namn- eller etikettsfilter"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileSelectParams.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.CLIP_OT_open.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.NODE_OT_add_image.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.OBJECT_OT_empty_image_add.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.SEQUENCER_OT_image_strip_add.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.SEQUENCER_OT_movie_strip_add.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.SEQUENCER_OT_sound_strip_add.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.TEXT_OT_open.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
msgid "Asset Catalog"
msgstr "Resurskatalog"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileSelectParams.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.CLIP_OT_open.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.NODE_OT_add_image.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.OBJECT_OT_empty_image_add.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.SEQUENCER_OT_image_strip_add.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.SEQUENCER_OT_movie_strip_add.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.SEQUENCER_OT_sound_strip_add.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
#. :src: bpy.types.TEXT_OT_open.sort_method:'ASSET_CATALOG'
msgid ""
"Sort the asset list so that assets in the same catalog are kept together. "
"Within a single catalog, assets are ordered by name. The catalogs are in "
"order of the flattened catalog hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"Sortera resurslistan så att resurser i samma katalog hålls samman. Inom en "
"och samma katalog sorteras resurserna efter namn. Katalogerna är ordnade "
"enligt den plattade kataloghierarkin."

#. :src: bpy.types.FileSelectParams.use_filter_asset_only
msgid "Only Assets"
msgstr "Endast resurser"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileSelectParams.use_filter_asset_only
msgid "Hide .blend files items that are not data-blocks with asset metadata"
msgstr "Dölj poster i .blend-filer som inte är datablock med resursmetadata"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileSelectParams.use_filter_blendid
msgid "Show .blend files items (objects, materials, etc.)"
msgstr "Visa poster i .blend-filer (objekt, material och så vidare)"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileAssetSelectParams
msgid "Asset Select Parameters"
msgstr "Resursvalsparametrar"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileAssetSelectParams.import_method
msgid "Determine how the asset will be imported"
msgstr "Bestäm hur resursen importeras"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileAssetSelectParams.import_method:'LINK'
#. :src: bpy.types.UserAssetLibrary.import_method:'LINK'
msgid "Import the assets as linked data-block"
msgstr "Importera resurserna som länkade datablock"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileAssetSelectParams.import_method:'APPEND'
#. :src: bpy.types.UserAssetLibrary.import_method:'APPEND'
msgid ""
"Import the assets as copied data-block, with no link to the original asset "
"data-block"
msgstr ""
"Importera resurserna som kopierade datablock, utan länk till resursens "
"ursprungliga datablock"

#. :src: bpy.types.FileAssetSelectParams.import_method:'APPEND_REUSE'
msgid ""
"Import the assets as copied data-block while avoiding multiple copies of "
"nested, typically heavy data. For example the textures of a material asset, "
"or the mesh of an object asset, don't have to be copied every time this "
"asset is imported. The instances of the asset share the data instead"
msgstr ""
"Importera resurserna som kopierade datablock samtidigt som du undviker flera "
"kopior av kapslade, vanligtvis tunga data. Texturerna i en materialresurs "
"eller meshet i en objektresurs behöver till exempel inte kopieras varje gång "
"resursen importeras. I stället delar resursernas instanser data"
